{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hell Descent is a story flatformer game about a girl who falls from this world to hell on her journey to escape from hell. We drew hell out of a simple abstract image of hell and into a concrete place called a museum. In addition to that, the Seven Sins who stand in the way of the girl's journey...\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We applied  Karma gauge to create immersion and speed!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It's fun with various puzzles and stages!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will the girl be able to escape the museum after the tour?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Who will the girl meet at the museum?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Why did the girl fall into hell?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Let's find out the answer to that from now on!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3632340?t=1744132820","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3632340?t=1744132820","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632340/1c1d7b8253bd6c3d270024548dd568380b03bee0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744132820","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632340/1c1d7b8253bd6c3d270024548dd568380b03bee0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744132820","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hell Descent is a story flatformer game about a girl who falls from this world to hell on her journey to escape from hell. We drew hell out of a simple abstract image of hell and into a concrete place called a museum. In addition to that, the Seven Sins who stand in the way of the girl's journey...\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We applied  Karma gauge to create immersion and speed!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It's fun with various puzzles and stages!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will the girl be able to escape the museum after the tour?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Who will the girl meet at the museum?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Why did the girl fall into hell?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Let's find out the answer to that from now on!</p>","developers":["BlueForgeStudio"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632340/ca1a2c57f3781fb9f589f24090aeaf607a727e74/header.jpg?t=1744132820","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Hell Descent","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Window 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i7-7500<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 750<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Window 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i7-7700<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1050<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["BlueForgeStudio"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Medo","rating":"10","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"10","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"G